  title: Generators
  key: 15
  topic: 4
  boardContentText: Only several generators actually affect something
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  contentText: "Observation: only some of the generators on the island actually power
    anything. The others run formally; physical connection to the experimental equipment
    is missing.\n\nReason: technical limitations of the network. The system was not
    designed for full capacity of all sources.\n\nFor proper operation of the apparatus,
    it is necessary to identify which generators affect the target.\n\n\u2014 Smith"
  paperSprite: {fileID: 0}
